  "story": "Bobby and Mia see a house in a tall tree. Dad helps them climb the ladder. Bobby gives a soft knock on the door. \"Come in!\" says Grandpa. There is a big window. Outside it, they see a picture of a jungle. \"Is it real?\" asks Mia. \"No. I painted it,\" says Grandpa. There are green leaves and funny monkeys in the picture. Grandpa opens a book. The children sit beside him and read. \"I like this little house,\" says Bobby. They put the book away. Dad helps them go down the ladder, one at a time.",
